Primary 2 English Exam (December 2025)
=====================================

Files
-----

- `primary2-english-exam-dec-2025.html`: Ready-to-print A4 exam template (Arabic RTL header + English questions).

How to use
----------

1. Open `primary2-english-exam-dec-2025.html` in a browser.
2. Print:
   - Paper size: **A4**
   - Margins: **Default** (the file sets `@page` margins)
   - Background graphics/colors: **On** (recommended to preserve styling)
